<title>ITALY: Italy's Seat names new managing director.</title>
<headline>Italy's Seat names new managing director.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian yellow pages publisher Seat Spa, which on Thursday made its debut on the Milan stock market, said in a statement its board had named Renato Bernini as managing director.</p>
<p>Seat also held its first board meeting on Thursday after its recent spin off from state telecommunications holding Stet.</p>
<p>The company's ordinary shares were trading at 604 lire by 1405 GMT after opening at 550.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +39 2 66129507</p>
</text>
